  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transforming wildlife conservation and livelihoods at the landscape scale in Mozambique (TRANSFORM)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the GEF PPG is to develop the project concept into a full project: Mozambique Wildlife Conservation for Development Integrated Program . As described in the project concept (PIF/child project concept note), this project will focus on the Rovuma-Lugenda Landscape in the northern part and the Gorongosa-Marromeu Landscape in the central part of Mozambique. It will contribute to landscape integrity and connectivity and diversification of sustainable livelihoods, through establishing</narrative>
  </description>
